	(property "Description" "INA219 current sensor board (INA219 DC Current Sensor, MCU-219 / ROB-002) 25.4 x 21.5mm, shunt 0.1Ω (R100). Pads 1-6 = header Vcc Gnd Scl Sda Vin- Vin+, 2.54mm, pad 1 square; pads 7-8 = screw terminal Vin- Vin+, 3.50mm, 15.77mm above the header row, wires in from the board edge away from the header. 4 mounting holes about 2.3mm. Scaled from a vendor photo, about 0.2mm; check with a caliper."
